<title>SNMP Routing — Current Architecture (Design C)</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #eaeeea;
    --surface: #f6f8f5;
    --surface-2: #fdfefc;
    --ink: #16211c;
    --ink-soft: #52625a;
